flowchart TD
  A[Grab 1080p frame] --> B{Blind check<br>brightness, sharpness}
  B -- blocked 3 s --> B1[Voice: camera blocked<br>log, pause monitoring] --> A
  B -- clear --> C[640x640 crop]
  C --> D[YOLO11n on Hailo]
  D --> E[Max score per class]
  E --> F[EMA update with dt]
  F --> G{EMA above<br>cutoff?}
  G -- no --> A
  G -- yes --> H{Held for<br>confirm time?}
  H -- no --> A
  H -- yes --> I{In cooldown?}
  I -- yes --> A
  I -- no --> J[Select tier]
  J --> K[LED pattern and<br>voice message]
  K --> L[Write event to SQLite]
  L --> A
